#: inc/gfg-metabox.php:45
msgid "Use Lightbox?"
msgstr "Gunakan Peti Cahaya?"

#: inc/gfg-metabox.php:50
msgid ""
"If set to YES, all galleries on this page/post will be opened in the lightbox"
msgstr ""
"Jika ditetapkan kepada YA, semua galeri di halaman/siaran ini akan dibuka "
"dalam peti cahaya"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:14
msgid "General"
msgstr "Umum"

#. translators: %s: review link
#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:24
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you use Gallery Lightbox Lite and found it useful then please consider "
"rating it and leaving your positive feedback %s."
msgstr ""
"Jika anda menggunakan Galeri Lightbox Lite dan mendapati ia berguna maka "
"sila pertimbangkan untuk menilainya dan meninggalkan maklum balas positif "
"anda %s."

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:26
msgid "here"
msgstr "di sini"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:33
msgid "Enable Lightbox in All Post/Page"
msgstr "Membolehkan Lightbox di semua selepas/halaman"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:50
msgid "Use this option to Enable or Disable the Lightbox in all Post or Page"
msgstr ""
"Guna opsyen ini untuk mendayakan atau menyahdayakan Lightbox di semua Post "
"atau Laman"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:55
msgid "Slideshow Auto Play"
msgstr "Tayangan slaid Auto Main"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:58
msgid "Should the lightbox gallery autoplay on start or not"
msgstr "Harus AutoMain Galeri lightbox pada mula atau tidak"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:63
msgid "Slideshow Interval"
msgstr "Tempoh tayangan slaid"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:88
msgid "The time in seconds when autoplaying a gallery. Default 3 seconds"
msgstr "Masa saat apabila autoplaying sebuah galeri. Lalai 3 saat"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:93
msgid "Show Thumbnails on Bottom"
msgstr "Tayangkan lakaran kenit di bawah"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:97
msgid "Use this option to show / hide gallery thumbnails"
msgstr "Gunakan pilihan ini untuk Papar / Sembunyi Galeri thumbnails"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:102
msgid "Show Thumbnails Caption"
msgstr "Tayang kapsyen lakaran kenit"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:106
msgid "Use this option to show / hide gallery thumbnails caption"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan pilihan ini untuk Papar / Sembunyi kapsyen lakaran kenit Galeri"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:111
msgid "Fancy Lightbox Caption"
msgstr "Fancy Lightbox kapsyen"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:115
msgid ""
"If Enabled the plugin will automatically convert uppercase the first "
"character of each word and replace - with spaces in a title. For example : "
"ferrari-f12-berlinetta will change to Ferrari F12 Berlinetta"
msgstr ""
"Jika dibenarkan plugin akan secara automatik menukarkan uppercase aksara "
"pertama setiap perkataan dan gantikan - dengan kawasan tajuk. Sebagai "
"contoh: ferrari-f12-berlinetta akan bertukar kepada Ferrari F12 Berlinetta"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:120
msgid "Overlay Color"
msgstr "Warna bertindih"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:122
msgid "Set your gallery overlay color. Default: #000000 "
msgstr "Menetapkan warna bertindih Galeri anda. Lalai: #000000 "

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:135
msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Save Perubahan"

#: inc/settings/glg-lightbox-settings.php:135
msgid "Settings Saved"
msgstr "Tetapan Disimpan"

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-docs.php:12
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentasi"

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-docs.php:14
msgid ""
"There are no complicated instructions for using Gallery Lightbox Lite "
"because this plugin designed to make all easy. Please watch the following "
"video and we believe that you will easily to understand it just in minutes."
msgstr ""
"Terdapat arahan tidak rumit untuk menggunakan Galeri Lightbox Lite kerana "
"plugin ini direka untuk memudahkan semua. Sila menonton berikut video dan "
"kami percaya bahawa anda akan dengan mudah memahami ia hanya dalam minit."

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-docs.php:16
msgid "For WordPress with Gallery Block"
msgstr "Untuk WordPress dengan Blok Galeri"

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-docs.php:18
msgid "For WordPress with Classic Editor"
msgstr "Untuk WordPress dengan Editor Klasik"

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-free-plugins.php:12
msgid "Free Install Plugins"
msgstr "Plugin percuma pemasangan"

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-free-plugins.php:16
#: inc/settings/pages/glg-premium-plugins.php:20
msgid "Retrieving data from server, please wait..."
msgstr "Mendapatkan data dari server, sila tunggu..."

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-premium-plugins.php:11
msgid "Premium Plugins"
msgstr "Plugin Premium"

#: inc/settings/pages/glg-premium-plugins.php:13
msgid ""
"Take your website to the next level with our Premium Plugins, which gives "
"you additional features more than you expected."
msgstr ""
"Membawa Laman web anda ke peringkat seterusnya dengan plugin Premium kami, "
"yang memberikan ciri-ciri tambahan yang lebih daripada anda dijangka."

